names>RC</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>A proteomic analysis of human cilia: identification of novel components.</article-title><source>Mol Cell Proteomics</source><year>2002</year><volume>1</volume><fpage>451</fpage><lpage>465</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">12169685</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1074/mcp.M200037-MCP200</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B11"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Pazour</surname><given-names>GJ</given-names></name><name><surname>Agrin</surname><given-names>N</given-names></name><name><surname>Leszyk</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name><name><surname>Witman</surname><given-names>GB</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Proteomic analysis of a eukaryotic cilium.</article-title><source>J Cell Biol</source><year>2005</year><volume>170</volume><fpage>103</fpage><lpage>113</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">15998802</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1083/jcb.200504008</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B12"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Broadhead</surname><given-names>R</given-names></name><name><surname>Dawe</surname><given-names>HR</given-names></name><name><surname>Farr</surname><given-names>H</given-names></name><name><surname>Griffiths</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Hart</surname><given-names>SR</given-names></name><name><surname>Portman</surname><given-names>N</given-names></name><name><surname>Shaw</surname><given-names>MK</given-names></name><name><surname>Ginger</surname><given-names>ML</given-names></name><name><surname>Gaskell</surname><given-names>SJ</given-names></name><name><surname>McKean</surname><given-names>PG</given-names></name><etal></etal></person-group><article-title>Flagellar motility is required for the viability of the bloodstream trypanosome.</article-title><source>Nature</source><year>2006</year><volume>440</volume><fpage>224